## @file
#  MT6899 UFS board initialisation library.
#
#  Supplies UfsBoardInit() + no-op UfsCal* hooks for the generic UfsDxe driver
#  on MediaTek MT6899 (rodin: ufshci@112b0000 + ufsphy@112a0000).
#
#  SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause-Patent
##

